WEBVTT

00:03:28.914 --> 00:03:31.493
Placebos may even reduce levels
of stress hormones,

00:03:31.493 --> 00:03:32.974
like adrenaline,

00:03:32.974 --> 00:03:35.995
which can slow the harmful effects
of an ailment.

00:03:35.995 --> 00:03:39.954
So shouldn't we celebrate
the placebo's bizarre benefits?

00:03:39.954 --> 00:03:41.439
Not necessarily.

00:03:41.439 --> 00:03:43.975
If somebody believes a fake treatment
has cured them,

00:03:43.975 --> 00:03:48.586
they may miss out on drugs
or therapies that are proven to work.

00:03:48.586 --> 00:03:51.774
Plus, the positive effects 
may fade over time,

00:03:51.774 --> 00:03:53.503
and often do.

00:03:53.503 --> 00:03:55.735
Placebos also cloud clinical results,

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:58.821
making scientists even 
more motivated to discover

00:03:58.821 --> 00:04:01.491
how they wield such power over us.